# Online multiplayer (optional)

Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` (gitignored via `*.local`) and fill in your Supabase project values:

```bash
copy .env.example .env.local
```

```env
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_publishable_anon_key
```

Apply `supabase/migrations/20260806000000_online_platform.sql` in the Supabase SQL editor (generic `profiles` / `rooms` / `room_members` / `room_messages` only). Offline play works with no env keys and never talks to Supabase.
